  "result": "Perfect! All 52 tests pass. I've successfully implemented invoice numbering:\n\n**Created src/numbering.js:**\n- **nextInvoiceNumber(existingNumbers, issueDate)** \u2014 generates the next invoice number\n  - Format: `INV-<year>-<counter>` where counter is zero-padded to 4 digits\n  - Counter starts at 0001 each year\n  - Finds the highest counter for the given year and returns the next one\n\n**Added to src/invoices.js:**\n- **issueInvoice(invoice, existingNumbers)** \u2014 issues a draft invoice\n  - Assigns the next available invoice number\n  - Changes status from `draft` to `issued`\n  - Refuses if invoice status isn't `draft` (returns `NOT_DRAFT`)\n  - Returns a new invoice without mutating the original\n\n**Tests cover:**\n- Number generation for first invoice of the year\n- Counter incrementing\n- Independent counters for each year\n- Counter reset when moving to a new year\n- Proper zero-padding to 4 digits\n- Handling unordered existing numbers\n- Ignoring numbers from other years\n- Issuing invoices with proper status change\n- Multi-year invoice sequences\n- Error handling for non-draft invoices\n- Immutability of original invoices",
